            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
          <zone h='6250' w='97657' x='1171' y='8073' id='25' type-v2='text'>
            <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#0b0b0b' fontsize='11'>Move $301k between channels: cut retargeting and B2, add B3 social prospecting and B1 generic search. Experiment-backed moves in full; history-only moves capped at ±25%; $151k of untested increases held in reserve.</run>
            </formatted-text>
