            <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0b0b0b' fontsize='14'>Channel truth: What does each channel really deliver, and how far do dashboards overstate it?</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
          <zone h='6250' w='97657' x='1171' y='8073' id='36' type-v2='text'>
            <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#0b0b0b' fontsize='11'>For B3 retargeting the platform reports 38 customers per $1,000; a randomised test finds about 2. Judge channels on the test and the model, never on platform numbers.</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
          <zone h='4688' w='18302' x='1171' y='14583' id='37' mode='compact' param='[Parameters].[Parameter 1]' type-v2='paramctrl' />
