          <zone h='5729' w='97657' x='1171' y='94010' id='59' type-v2='text'>
            <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#52514e' fontsize='9'>Causal evidence: each change was assigned at random. Bars run from the low to the high end of the range; blue = the range excludes zero. Yearly values scale the test result and are assumptions.</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{0C470A9F-E5AB-4E55-A1C8-32570D36208E}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard name='6 Data trust'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='768' maxwidth='1366' minheight='768' minwidth='1366' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='69' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='3125' w='100000' x='0' y='0' id='61' type-v2='text'>
            <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#52514e' fontsize='9'>Synthetic data: methods demonstration, not company results</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='background-color' value='#e4e3df' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='4167' w='97657' x='1171' y='3646' id='62' type-v2='text'>
            <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0b0b0b' fontsize='14'>Data trust: Can these numbers be trusted, and where are they wrong?</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
          <zone h='6250' w='97657' x='1171' y='8073' id='63' type-v2='text'>
            <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#0b0b0b' fontsize='11'>5 problems found: two tracking outages, a tracking change on B1 social from July 2025, duplicate B2 leads and a late cost restatement. Platform figures overstate conversions by up to 1.6×.</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
          <zone h='4688' w='18302' x='1171' y='14583' id='64' mode='compact' param='[Parameters].[Parameter 1]' type-v2='paramctrl' />
          <zone h='4688' w='18302' x='20205' y='14583' id='65' mode='compact' param='[Parameters].[Parameter 4]' type-v2='paramctrl' />
          <zone h='24740' w='97657' x='1171' y='20052' id='66' name='Data issues' />
          <zone h='47917' w='97657' x='1171' y='45573' id='67' name='Platform CRM ratio' />
          <zone h='5729' w='97657' x='1171' y='94010' id='68' type-v2='text'>
            <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#52514e' fontsize='9'>Darker = the platform claims more conversions than the CRM records. Tracking outages show as pale weeks (ratio 0); B1 social prospecting steps down from July 2025 when its tag changed. Hover for the flag.</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{CD5DB1D4-485F-4EF6-A557-A5D1721224AB}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
